g.","fingerprint":"WB-7|tests/Uinsure.Policies.Web.Tests/e2e/N2/wb-7.spec.ts|renew-drawer-overlap-unmeasured","testable":true,"suggested_test":"Given RenewPolicy.tsx at bab20778, When the new renew never-covers and ends-at-footer checks run at 1440 and 390, Then they fail (red) on the api-unreachable state, with the drawer meeting the unreachable banner, and they pass once I1's dock is in place (tests/Uinsure.Policies.Web.Tests/e2e/N2/wb-7.spec.ts)","untestable_reason":null}],"previous_attempts":["attempt 1: reviewer PASS, security PASS (5 P2, none on wb-renew); at Pause 2, D1 called wb-renew a defect (QA step 16: the open drawer covers renew's content). The bare mount at RenewPolicy.tsx:233 is from N2's A1 I4 direction ('mount untagged, as before N2'), which fixed parity but not the sticky range. It is the same mechanism as N2 inv-011 I1 (sell) in a new file, so it gets a new fingerprint."]}
